{
  "_readme": [
    "The machine-readable gap register for Orbit's chrome.* surface on WebKit (WKWebExtension) plus Orbit's chrome wrapper.",
    "",
    "Each namespace names who provides it:",
    "  wrapper         ChromeAPIWrapperScript creates it (the inventory is Orbit/Engine/WebKit/ChromeAPISurfaceInventory.swift)",
    "  webkit          WebKit implements it natively",
    "  webkit+wrapper  WebKit implements it and the wrapper adds members WebKit leaves out",
    "  none            nothing provides it",
    "",
    "status:",
    "  complete    every upstream member exists",
    "  partial     the missing* lists are the upstream members that do not exist",
    "  unvendored  wrapper-provided core namespace whose schema is not vendored; the generated wrapper is pinned by the inventory",
    "  absent      the namespace does not exist; reason says why",
    "  unverified  WebKit may or may not provide it and a service-worker reflection cannot tell; reason is webkitVariable",
    "",
    "How each half is proven, in both directions (a regression fails, and so does an implemented member that is still listed):",
    "  wrapper members   OrbitTests/ExtensionSchemaConformanceTests runs the generated wrapper in JavaScriptCore and diffs it against the vendored schemas.",
    "  WebKit members    OrbitAppTests/WebKitExtensionRuntimeSurfaceReflectionLiveTests walks the real chrome object in a real MV3 service worker.",
    "",
    "missing*: upstream members confirmed absent. uncertain*: members whose presence depends on the WebKit version; the live suite accepts either state and reports the one it saw, so move an entry to missing* or delete it once observed.",
    "",
    "reason, on an absent namespace:",
    "  notPorted        in scope, Orbit has not built it",
    "  outOfScope       ChromeOS hardware or shell, enterprise, or the Chrome Apps model Orbit does not host",
    "  chromeInternal   allowlist-only; no third-party extension can reach it",
    "  webkitImpossible WebKit exposes no hook that could provide it",
    "  unclassified     new upstream and not yet triaged; the test rejects this value",
    "",
    "neverDispatchedEvents: events that exist and are never fired. A schema diff cannot see them. Each must also be notDispatched in EventLiveness.json.",
    "permissionsWithoutProvider: Chrome permissions neither the wrapper nor WKWebExtension.Permission gives any meaning to."
  ],
  "engine": "WebKit WKWebExtension + Orbit chrome wrapper",
  "upstreamVersion": "152.0.7977.54",
